    <item>
      <title>布林无人机对特朗普关税的影响</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2025-04-14/brinc-drones-on-impact-of-trump-s-tariffs-video</link>
      <description><![CDATA[总部位于西雅图的布林无人机使遥控的飞机专注于战术和应急响应，这对特朗普政府的关税政策产生了积极影响，其中国竞争对手受到职责的打击。随着与美国与美国的贸易战争的加剧，中国将该公司添加到其出口控制名单中。创始人兼首席执行官布雷克·雷斯尼克（Blake Resnick）在“彭博社：中国秀”上发表讲话。 （来源：彭博）]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2025-04-14/brinc-drones-on-impact-of-trump-s-tariffs-video</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 05:07:34 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>奥拉姆（Olam）从沙特出售中花费20亿美元来降低债务</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/olam-to-spend-2-billion-from-saudi-sale-on-lowering-its-debt</link>
      <description><![CDATA[新加坡食品企业集团Olam Group Ltd.表示，它将使用最近在其农业企业单位的股份出售中的收益来偿还债务，并在周一将其股票上涨了4％。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/olam-to-spend-2-billion-from-saudi-sale-on-lowering-its-debt</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 04:36:21 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>随着贸易灾害恶化，中国的商品进口了bar石油</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/china-s-commodities-imports-shrink-bar-oil-as-trade-woes-worsen</link>
      <description><![CDATA[中国的商品大多进口在3月份的同比同比下降，这是特朗普政府通过对中国商品施加惩罚性征税来扼杀双边贸易的最后一个月。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/china-s-commodities-imports-shrink-bar-oil-as-trade-woes-worsen</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 04:28:59 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>尽管印度尼西亚的外国储备还记录了卢比</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/indonesia-s-foreign-reserves-hit-record-high-despite-rupiah-rout</link>
      <description><![CDATA[印度尼西亚的外汇储备上个月获得了26亿美元，即使全球市场动荡袭击了印第安纳州，也达到了另一个创纪录的纪录。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/indonesia-s-foreign-reserves-hit-record-high-despite-rupiah-rout</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 03:25:10 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>中国出口在美国的关税之前膨胀</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/chinese-exports-rise-ahead-of-us-tariffs-that-will-snarl-trade</link>
      <description><![CDATA[在本月美国对美国实施的大规模关税加息之前，中国的出口将在3月反弹，近记录的货物流向东南亚。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/chinese-exports-rise-ahead-of-us-tariffs-that-will-snarl-trade</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 03:07:24 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>股票期货随着交易者的消化简短技术关税缓刑而上升</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/stock-futures-rise-as-traders-digest-brief-tech-tariff-reprieve</link>
      <description><![CDATA[随着投资者从特朗普政府进行了对电话，计算机和受欢迎的消费电子电子产品的互惠关税豁免的来回征收，美国股票期货获得了。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/stock-futures-rise-as-traders-digest-brief-tech-tariff-reprieve</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 23:00:47 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>股票收益暂停技术关税，美元瀑布：市场包装</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/us-futures-rise-after-trump-pauses-tech-tariffs-markets-wrap</link>
      <description><![CDATA[唐纳德·特朗普总统在一系列消费电子产品上停止进口关税后，亚洲股票提高了，在市场动荡不安的一周之后提升了情绪。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/us-futures-rise-after-trump-pauses-tech-tariffs-markets-wrap</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 22:40:41 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>新兴市场面临关税动荡的“破坏球”</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/emerging-markets-face-wrecking-ball-from-tariff-turmoil</link>
      <description><![CDATA[特朗普政府的关税产生的动荡正在加强人们的看法，即最风险的资产面临着更多损失。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/emerging-markets-face-wrecking-ball-from-tariff-turmoil</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 12:30:00 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>中国的信用扩张节目预测债券销售洪水</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/china-s-credit-expansion-beats-forecast-on-bond-offering-deluge</link>
      <description><![CDATA[由于政府加速债券产品以帮助经济抵消了飙升美国关税的影响，中国的信誉比3月的预期越来越多。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/china-s-credit-expansion-beats-forecast-on-bond-offering-deluge</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 10:14:42 GMT</pubDate>
